ounds.de/episode/urn:ard:episode:d90d440cdcdef881/</guid><link>https://www.ardsounds.de/episode/urn:ard:episode:d90d440cdcdef881/</link><enclosure url="https://rbprogressivedl-a.akamaihd.net/clips/zt/welt/yl/yLj1ITqpim/yLj1ITqpim_audio_128k_stereo.mp3" length="3840428" type="audio/mp3" /><media:content url="https://rbprogressivedl-a.akamaihd.net/clips/zt/welt/yl/yLj1ITqpim/yLj1ITqpim_audio_128k_stereo.mp3" medium="audio" duration="240" type="audio/mp3" /><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0200</pubDate><itunes:duration>240</itunes:duration><itunes:image href="https://api.ardmediathek.de/image-service/images/urn:ard:image:6d9fd35dae327306?w=448&amp;ch=fc73b700ac4e075c" /></item><item><title>13. Oktober 1916: Katzensteuer in Blasewitz eingeführt</title><description>Heute vor 110 Jahren führte der damalige Dresdner Vorort Blasewitz versuchsweise eine Katzensteuer ein. </description><guid>https://www.ardsounds.de/episode/urn:ard:episode:237f80d169eba583/</guid><link>https://www.ardsounds.de/episode/urn:ard:episode:237f80d169eba583/</link><enclosure url="https://rbprogressivedl-a.akamaihd.net/clips/zt/welt/ht/hTBTirHVie/hTBTirHVie_audio_128k_stereo.mp3" length="3796268" type="audio/mp3" /><media:content url="https://rbprogressivedl-a.akamaihd.net/clips/zt/welt/ht/hTBTirHVie/hTBTirHVie_audio_128k_stereo.mp3" medium="audio" duration="237" type="audio/mp3" /><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0200</pubDate><itunes:duration>237</itunes:duration><itunes:image href="https://api.ardmediathek.de/image-service/images/urn:ard:image:8c920449b0a2033b?w=448&amp;ch=d1ad9ba12b6eacc0" /></item></channel></rss>